## 4. End-to-End Execution Flow (The Production Lifecycle)

```
[1. Upload]
  Creator selects video in Web SPA
  ➔ POST /api/uploads (Request V4 Signed GCS URL)
  ➔ Web SPA uploads raw MP4 directly to GCS bucket (media_raw)
  ➔ POST /api/uploads/{upload_id}/complete
  ➔ Firestore records SourceMedia(status=UPLOADED)

[2. Analyze & Transcribe]
  POST /api/productions/{p_id}/transcribe
  ➔ Audio demuxed to 16kHz PCM WAV
  ➔ Gemini 3.5 Transcribe generates word-level timestamps
  ➔ Firestore stores Transcript with word start/end timings

[3. AI Editorial Dialogue Pass]
  POST /api/productions/{p_id}/editorial/run
  ➔ Leo (Editor) analyzes transcript + video via Gemini 3.7 Flash
  ➔ Leo generates DialoguePassReport (removes false starts, redundancy, filler words)
  ➔ Firestore stores EditorialRun with detailed reasoning

[4. Safe EDL Assembly]
  POST /api/productions/{p_id}/edl/assemble
  ➔ CutSafetyPipeline compares Leo's cuts with audio envelope & word boundaries
  ➔ Adjusts cut start/end to zero-crossing silence regions (prevents word clipping)
  ➔ Inserts 15ms audio micro-crossfades
  ➔ Generates canonical EditDecisionList (EDL) JSON

[5. Deterministic FFmpeg Render]
  POST /api/productions/{p_id}/renders (RenderType: MASTER_16_9)
  ➔ RenderService builds FFmpeg filter-graph from EDL
  ➔ Cloud Run renders final 1080p MP4 master
  ➔ Output MP4 uploaded directly to GCS media_raw bucket
  ➔ Firestore records RenderArtifact(status=COMPLETED)

[6. Multimodal Quality Verification & Playback]
  POST /api/productions/{p_id}/qa/review
  ➔ Iris verifies rendered video against sync and loudness benchmarks (-16 LUFS)
  ➔ GET /api/productions/{p_id}/playback
  ➔ Returns signed GCS playback URLs to Web SPA VideoStage
```
